# React Rendering Optimization Patterns

## Preventing Unnecessary Renders

### 1. Memoization
```jsx
const ProductCard = React.memo(({ product }) => {
  return <div>{product.name}</div>;
}, (prev, next) => prev.product.id === next.product.id);
